      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "今日は %@ まで"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Includes %@ carried from last month": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先月からの繰り越し %@ を含みます"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "left of %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "残り（上限 %@）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "over the limit": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上限を超えています"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No Expenses Yet": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "まだ支出がありません"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap the + button to add your first expense for this month.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "＋ボタンで、今月最初の支出を追加できます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No Monthly Limit": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "月の上限が未設定です"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set a limit for the month and this screen shows what is left of it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "月の上限を決めると、残りがこの画面に表示されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No History Yet": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "まだ履歴がありません"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your monthly spending appears here once you add expenses.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "支出を追加すると、月ごとの支出がここに表示されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Expenses you add will be listed here by month.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "追加した支出が、月ごとにここへ並びます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing to chart yet": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "まだグラフにするものがありません"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add an expense and the charts fill in.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "支出を追加すると、グラフが埋まります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing in this period.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この期間の支出はありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing recorded yet.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "まだ記録がありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No expense is in another currency yet.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "他の通貨の支出はまだありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Limit in Another Currency": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上限が他の通貨です"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Totals and budgets use the home currency. An expense keeps the currency you entered it in.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "合計と予算は基準通貨で表示します。各支出は入力した通貨のまま残ります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Totals and budgets use this. An expense keeps the currency you entered it in.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "合計と予算はこの通貨で表示します。各支出は入力した通貨のまま残ります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Osaifu keeps your expenses in your private iCloud database. iCloud decides when it sends them, so a change can take a moment to reach another device.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "お財布は支出をあなた専用の iCloud に保存します。送信の時期は iCloud が決めるため、他の端末に届くまで少し時間がかかることがあります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off, each month starts at the full limit. On, what was left of last month is added to this month.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "オフのとき、毎月は上限いっぱいから始まります。オンのとき、先月の残りが今月に加算されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off, an expense in another currency stays out of the totals and the budget. On, it is counted at the rate you give. Nothing is fetched.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "オフのとき、他の通貨の支出は合計にも予算にも入りません。オンのとき、入力したレートで換算します。レートの自動取得は行いません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Osaifu then says what is left of the month, and what is left today. Leave it empty if you would rather not set one; Budget can set it later.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "設定すると、今月の残りと今日の残りが表示されます。決めない場合は空のままで構いません。あとから「予算」で設定できます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These are left out of the total, because a total of two currencies would be wrong.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ふたつの通貨を足した合計は正しくないため、これらは合計に含めていません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Left out of the total. Settings, under FX Currency, can count them at a rate you give.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "合計に含めていません。「設定」の「外貨」で、入力したレートで換算できます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your limit is %@, and your home currency is now %@. Give a rate for %@ in Settings, or set a new limit.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上限は %@ ですが、基準通貨は %@ になっています。「設定」で %@ のレートを入力するか、新しい上限を設定してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The expenses stay. The amount is kept, so setting a limit again offers it back.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "支出はそのまま残ります。金額も残るので、次に上限を設定するときに同じ金額を提案します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sample data adds randomized expenses across the last several months for trying out the charts.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "サンプルデータは、グラフを試すために直近数か月分の支出をランダムに追加します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Deleting cannot be undone, and it reaches your other devices.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "削除は取り消せません。他の端末にも反映されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This permanently removes every expense and can't be undone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "すべての支出を完全に削除します。取り消しはできません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delete all expenses?": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "すべての支出を削除しますか？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "^[%lld expense](inflect: true) in another currency": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "他の通貨の支出が %lld 件"
          }
        }
